-		//usleep(sleepTime); // removed so we can scan for input
+		// A page that requests continuous updates keeps input_timeout_ms at
+		// zero. Polling in a tight loop until the next frame consumes a core
+		// even with no input. Keep the frame deadline, but yield for at most
+		// four milliseconds after an empty poll.
+		if (!got_event && diff.tv_nsec < timeout) {
